            },
            {
              q: 'What does it cost?',
              a: "We work directly with each fleet at this stage rather than publishing a self-serve plan — reach out and we'll figure out the right setup together.",
            },
            {
              q: 'Why did you create CharterWise?',
              a: "I've chartered many boats across the Mediterranean, Caribbean, and beyond. Every time, I arrived without context about the boat's true condition. I built CharterWise to capture the handover moment — and realised the data is just as valuable to the company running the fleet as it is to the sailor stepping aboard.",
